{"id":"3dcef588a10bf884","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-kasummable.md","title":"k-asummable function","display":"df-kasummable — k-asummable function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-kasummable","aliases":["27-df-kasummable"],"display":"df-kasummable — k-asummable function","depends_on":["[[27-df-truefalse]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§9.3 Definition 9.2","source_printed_pages":"414","source_pdf_pages":"438","verification_status":"source-definition-checked-repeated-points-and-all-orders-through-k","local_review_status":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-kasummable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-kasummable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-kasummable — k-asummable function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" href=\"?note=98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" title=\"27-df-truefalse\">27-df-truefalse</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§9.3 Definition 9.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"414"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"438"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked-repeated-points-and-all-orders-through-k"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq2\">\\(k\\geq2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(f),F(f)\">\\(T(f),F(f)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" href=\"?note=98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" title=\"27-df-truefalse\">27-df-truefalse</a>。</li>\n<li>对有限集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^r\">\\(A^r\\)</span> 表示长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 的有序元组集合，允许重复坐标。引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Summable}^{(k)}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Summable}^{(k)}_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Asummable}^{(k)}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Asummable}^{(k)}_n\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Asummable}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Asummable}_n\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Summable}^{(k)}_n\\coloneqq\\left\\{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\ \\middle|\\ \\exists r\\in\\{2,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\\exists(x_1,\\ldots,x_r)\\in T(f)^r\\;\\exists(y_1,\\ldots,y_r)\\in F(f)^r\\;\\left(\\forall i\\in[n]\\;\\sum_{j=1}^r(x_j)_i=\\sum_{j=1}^r(y_j)_i\\right)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Summable}^{(k)}_n\\coloneqq\\left\\{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\ \\middle|\\ \\exists r\\in\\{2,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\\exists(x_1,\\ldots,x_r)\\in T(f)^r\\;\\exists(y_1,\\ldots,y_r)\\in F(f)^r\\;\\left(\\forall i\\in[n]\\;\\sum_{j=1}^r(x_j)_i=\\sum_{j=1}^r(y_j)_i\\right)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Asummable}^{(k)}_n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\setminus\\mathrm{Summable}^{(k)}_n,\\qquad\\mathrm{Asummable}_n\\coloneqq\\bigcap_{k\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge2}}\\mathrm{Asummable}^{(k)}_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Asummable}^{(k)}_n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\setminus\\mathrm{Summable}^{(k)}_n,\\qquad\\mathrm{Asummable}_n\\coloneqq\\bigcap_{k\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge2}}\\mathrm{Asummable}^{(k)}_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原书 §9.3，Definition 9.2，印刷 p.414／PDF p.438；已逐项核对。原书的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>-asummable 禁止每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\\leq r\\leq k\">\\(2\\leq r\\leq k\\)</span> 的等和见证，不只是禁止恰好 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 点；本次修正这一语义差异。</li>\n<li>两边允许重复点由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(f)^r,F(f)^r\">\\(T(f)^r,F(f)^r\\)</span> 直接编码，不能改成由互异点组成的子集。常函数有一侧为空，故属于每个上述 asummable 类。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-truefalse","status":"resolved","id":"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-truefalse]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-truefalse","status":"resolved","id":"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$k\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $k\\geq2$；$T(f),F(f)$ 与 $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ 来自 [[27-df-truefalse]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"k\\geq2","display":false},{"tex":"T(f),F(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A^r","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Summable}^{(k)}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Asummable}^{(k)}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Asummable}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Summable}^{(k)}_n\\coloneqq\\left\\{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\ \\middle|\\ \\exists r\\in\\{2,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\\exists(x_1,\\ldots,x_r)\\in T(f)^r\\;\\exists(y_1,\\ldots,y_r)\\in F(f)^r\\;\\left(\\forall i\\in[n]\\;\\sum_{j=1}^r(x_j)_i=\\sum_{j=1}^r(y_j)_i\\right)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Asummable}^{(k)}_n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\setminus\\mathrm{Summable}^{(k)}_n,\\qquad\\mathrm{Asummable}_n\\coloneqq\\bigcap_{k\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge2}}\\mathrm{Asummable}^{(k)}_n.","display":true},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"2\\leq r\\leq k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"T(f)^r,F(f)^r","display":false}],"bytes":1937,"backlinks":[{"id":"634d77c6ddef8bdb","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Threshold}_9,\\mathrm{Asummable}^{(2)}_9$ 见 [[27-df-threshold]]、[[27-df-kasummable]]。$a=(14,18,24,26,27,30,31,36,37)$。下列 $X^j,Y^j$ 均为 $\\mathbb B^9$ 中向量；$f$ 由下式定义。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-249","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-kasummable|df-kasummable — k-asummable function]]"},{"id":"125f1083d1ad7862","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Asummable}^{(k)}_n$ 见 [[27-df-kasummable]]，其中同侧点可重复，且排除每个长度 $2\\le r\\le k$ 的等和见证；$\\mathrm{Threshold}_n$ 见 [[27-df-threshold]]。$n$、$k$ 的量词论域在下式中给出。"},{"id":"ff306e0cc6f0a65e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{Threshold}_n$ 与 $\\mathrm{Asummable}_n,\\mathrm{Asummable}^{(k)}_n$ 见 [[27-df-threshold]]、[[27-df-kasummable]]。"},{"id":"87c16a3fe5e91979","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"书内归约：若证书统一有界 c，则非阈值 g 的每个证书 Q 中真假点凸包相交，否则有阈值函数匹配 Q。把 Q 作为矩阵的行并去除重复列后，列数≤2^c，保留真假凸包相交及有理等和见证。只有有限多个这样的压缩后真假点对，故最小等长（允许重复）等和见证的长度有统一最大值 α。与被引用的 Winder α-asummable 非阈值函数相矛盾。该论证使用的 asummable 量词是禁止所有 2≤r≤α 的等和见证，见 [[27-df-kasummable]]。无有界证书再由有限方程的必要条件推出无有限方程；无限表征的存在由阈值闭包定理给出。"}],"outgoing":["98e5c19fe4a2b9e2"]}